XPU: FP8 LM head (VLLM_XPU_LMHEAD_FP8=1).

Stores ParallelLMHead weights as per-row FP8 and runs them with
fp8_gemm_w8a16. Halves the LM-head bytes read per step (it also runs once per
MTP draft step) and frees ~0.6 GiB/rank for KV cache.

